WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:08,980
where did it come from

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,320
There are still grapes at this time

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,280
I picked it yesterday through the old woods.

4
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:22,430
You're the only one today. Shut up and want to eat. Come and get it yourself.

5
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:32,340
Okay, come again

6
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:35,100
you did it on purpose

7
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,820
One piece at a time, let's do it one piece at a time

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:54,540
My eldest brother is running out of lessons soon.

9
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,020
It's you who don't want to hear it

10
00:00:56,580 --> 00:01:15,260
Is there a ship?

11
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:17,020
But why does it light up and then disappear?

12
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:19,100
Don’t know the enemy and don’t paint
